<!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!--]--><!--]--></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><span></span><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!--]--><!--[--><div id=\"row-z7qgXZJ2S2\" data-animation-class=\"\" data-entrance-clip=\"1\" style=\"\" class=\"row-align-center noBorder radius0 none c-row c-wrapper row-z7qgXZJ2S2\"><!----><!----><div class=\"inner\"><!----><!--[--><!--[--><div id=\"col-pzanyb1er_\" data-animation-class=\"\" data-entrance-clip=\"1\" style=\"\" class=\"borderFull radius10 none c-column c-wrapper col-pzanyb1er_\"><!----><!----><div class=\"vertical inner\"><!----><!--[--><!--[--><div id=\"faq-YdObIMsBDl\" data-animation-class=\"\" style=\"\" class=\"c-custom-code c-wrapper faq-YdObIMsBDl\" data-animate=\"fade-up\" data-delay=\"120\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><span></span><div id=\"faq-YdObIMsBDl__custom-code\" class=\"custom-code-container cfaq-YdObIMsBDl\"><!-- FAQ accordion (same design as the blog FAQ). scripts/convert.mjs turns every GoHighLevel FAQ element into a\n     custom-code element carrying this markup, with that element's own questions and answers (the items placeholder below).\n     One delegated click handler serves every copy (desktop + mobile) and survives hydration re-renders. -->\n<style>\n  /* the GoHighLevel FAQ container class kept a 2px border; the accordion draws its own */\n  .custom-code-container[class*=\"cfaq-\"] { border: 0 !important; padding: 0 !important; background: transparent !important; box-shadow: none !important; }\n  .snz-faq { display: grid; gap: 12px; width: 100%; --snz-faq-navy: #001489; --snz-faq-orange: #f58433; }\n  .snz-faq__item {\n    border-radius: 18px;\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);\n    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\n    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 20, 137, 0.09);\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px -22px rgba(0, 20, 137, 0.35);\n    transition: border-color 0.25s, box-shadow 0.25s;\n  }\n  .snz-faq__item:hover, .snz-faq__item.is-open { border-color: rgba(245, 132, 51, 0.45); box-shadow: 0 18px 40px -24px rgba(0, 20, 137, 0.45); }\n  .snz-faq__q { margin: 0; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; }\n  .snz-faq__btn {\n    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px;\n    width: 100%; padding: 18px 20px; border: 0; background: transparent; cursor: pointer; text-align: left;\n    font-family: var(--headlinefont, 'Montserrat', sans-serif); font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.08rem; line-height: 1.35; color: var(--snz-faq-navy);\n    border-radius: 18px; -webkit-appearance: none; appearance: none;\n  }\n  .snz-faq__btn:hover { color: #d96f27; }\n  .snz-faq__btn:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--snz-faq-orange); outline-offset: -4px; }\n  .snz-faq__chevron { flex: 0 0 auto; width: 22px; height: 22px; color: var(--snz-faq-orange); transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.22, 0.61, 0.36, 1); }\n  .snz-faq__item.is-open .snz-faq__chevron { transform: rotate(180deg); }\n  .snz-faq__panel { display: grid; grid-template-rows: 0fr; transition: grid-template-rows 0.34s cubic-bezier(0.22, 0.61, 0.36, 1); }\n  .snz-faq__item.is-open .snz-faq__panel { grid-template-rows: 1fr; }\n  .snz-faq__inner { min-height: 0; overflow: hidden; }\n  .snz-faq__a { padding: 0 20px 20px; font-family: var(--contentfont, 'Montserrat', sans-serif); font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #3f4460; }\n  .snz-faq__a p { margin: 0 0 0.6em; }\n  .snz-faq__a p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n  .snz-faq__a a { color: var(--snz-faq-navy); text-decoration: underline; }\n  @media (max-width: 767px) {\n    .snz-faq__btn { padding: 16px; font-size: 1rem; }\n    .snz-faq__a { padding: 0 16px 16px; font-size: 0.95rem; }\n  }\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n    .snz-faq__chevron, .snz-faq__panel, .snz-faq__item { transition: none; }\n  }\n</style>\n<div class=\"snz-faq\" data-snz-faq=\"faq-YdObIMsBDl\">\n<div class=\"snz-faq__item is-open\"><h3 class=\"snz-faq__q\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"snz-faq__btn\" id=\"faq-YdObIMsBDl-q0\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"faq-YdObIMsBDl-a0\"><span>¿Por qué elegir Snooze Mattress + Wellness en McAllen?</span><svg class=\"snz-faq__chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div class=\"snz-faq__panel\" id=\"faq-YdObIMsBDl-a0\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-YdObIMsBDl-q0\"><div class=\"snz-faq__inner\"><div class=\"snz-faq__a\"><p>Tenemos los mejores precios de colchones de la ciudad gracias a nuestras ofertas competitivas y a que igualamos precios, ofrecemos una Garantía de Confort de Sueño única para tu colchón nuevo, y te recibiremos con una sonrisa en nuestras pijamas Snooze Blues. ¡Para nuestro negocio familiar sería un honor atenderte!</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"snz-faq__item\"><h3 class=\"snz-faq__q\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"snz-faq__btn\" id=\"faq-YdObIMsBDl-q1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-YdObIMsBDl-a1\"><span>¿Qué es Dream Mapping?</span><svg class=\"snz-faq__chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div class=\"snz-faq__panel\" id=\"faq-YdObIMsBDl-a1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-YdObIMsBDl-q1\"><div class=\"snz-faq__inner\"><div class=\"snz-faq__a\"><p>Dream Mapping analiza tus puntos de presión y tus preferencias para recomendarte el colchón perfecto para tu cuerpo.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"snz-faq__item\"><h3 class=\"snz-faq__q\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"snz-faq__btn\" id=\"faq-YdObIMsBDl-q2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-YdObIMsBDl-a2\"><span>¿Cuánto tiempo toma completar el proceso de Dream Mapping?</span><svg class=\"snz-faq__chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div class=\"snz-faq__panel\" id=\"faq-YdObIMsBDl-a2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-YdObIMsBDl-q2\"><div class=\"snz-faq__inner\"><div class=\"snz-faq__a\"><p>¡Solo unos 5 minutos! Después, nuestros Sleep Coaches te llevarán únicamente a los colchones que coinciden con tu cuerpo.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"snz-faq__item\"><h3 class=\"snz-faq__q\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"snz-faq__btn\" id=\"faq-YdObIMsBDl-q3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-YdObIMsBDl-a3\"><span>¿Las parejas pueden usar Dream Mapping?</span><svg class=\"snz-faq__chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div class=\"snz-faq__panel\" id=\"faq-YdObIMsBDl-a3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-YdObIMsBDl-q3\"><div class=\"snz-faq__inner\"><div class=\"snz-faq__a\"><p>Sí, personalizamos las recomendaciones de colchón tanto para personas que duermen solas como para parejas.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"snz-faq__item\"><h3 class=\"snz-faq__q\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"snz-faq__btn\" id=\"faq-YdObIMsBDl-q4\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-YdObIMsBDl-a4\"><span>¿Hay presión para comprar?</span><svg class=\"snz-faq__chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div class=\"snz-faq__panel\" id=\"faq-YdObIMsBDl-a4\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-YdObIMsBDl-q4\"><div class=\"snz-faq__inner\"><div class=\"snz-faq__a\"><p>¡Para nada! Nuestra tecnología Dream Mapping elimina todas las adivinanzas al buscar el colchón perfecto para ti. Una vez que completas el Dream Map, la tecnología descarta prácticamente el 85% de nuestros productos, así que obtienes un colchón verdaderamente a la medida de tu cuerpo.</p><p></p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"snz-faq__item\"><h3 class=\"snz-faq__q\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"snz-faq__btn\" id=\"faq-YdObIMsBDl-q5\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-YdObIMsBDl-a5\"><span>¿Ofrecen financiamiento?</span><svg class=\"snz-faq__chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div class=\"snz-faq__panel\" id=\"faq-YdObIMsBDl-a5\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-YdObIMsBDl-q5\"><div class=\"snz-faq__inner\"><div class=\"snz-faq__a\"><p>¡Sí! ¡Ofrecemos una variedad de excelentes opciones de financiamiento para que consigas el sueño que mereces!</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"snz-faq__item\"><h3 class=\"snz-faq__q\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"snz-faq__btn\" id=\"faq-YdObIMsBDl-q6\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-YdObIMsBDl-a6\"><span>¿Qué tipo de colchones manejan?</span><svg class=\"snz-faq__chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div class=\"snz-faq__panel\" id=\"faq-YdObIMsBDl-a6\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-YdObIMsBDl-q6\"><div class=\"snz-faq__inner\"><div class=\"snz-faq__a\"><p>Snooze Mattress &amp; Wellness maneja todas las principales marcas de colchones, además de colchones hechos a la medida disponibles únicamente en Snooze. Con una amplia variedad de colchones para elegir, nuestros Sleep Coaches no tendrán ningún problema en encontrar tu colchón perfecto para darte el sueño que mereces.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"snz-faq__item\"><h3 class=\"snz-faq__q\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"snz-faq__btn\" id=\"faq-YdObIMsBDl-q7\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-YdObIMsBDl-a7\"><span>¿Ofrecen entrega de colchones?</span><svg class=\"snz-faq__chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div class=\"snz-faq__panel\" id=\"faq-YdObIMsBDl-a7\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-YdObIMsBDl-q7\"><div class=\"snz-faq__inner\"><div class=\"snz-faq__a\"><p>Por supuesto, entregamos e instalamos tu colchón nuevo, y también nos llevamos tu colchón viejo si ya no lo necesitas</p></div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n\n</div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!--]--><!--]--></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><span></span><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!--]--><!--]--></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><span></span><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!--